{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>טרף</b> — He spoke the word and they despoiled Egypt, as in: <i>haTriefeni</i> [he fed me]. The sense of <b>He remembers His covenant forever</b> is the covenant between the pieces, where it is written: <i>and afterward they shall come out with great possessions</i>."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 111, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:39:25.686122148Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}